Docker Image Tagging on App Server 3
Problem: Pull busybox:musl image on App Server 3 and re-tag (create new tag) this image as busybox:news.

Solution:

bash
# Pull the image
docker pull busybox:musl

# Re-tag it
docker tag busybox:musl busybox:news

# Verify both tags exist
docker images | grep busybox
